死罪解脱」。是日皆報殺四百餘人。其後郡中不寒而栗，猾民佐吏爲治。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"寧成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0012","start":12,"end":17,"surface":"御史大夫弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"寧成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0064","start":64,"end":70,"surface":"關東吏隸郡國","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"寧成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"義縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"寧成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"寧成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0124","start":124,"end":125,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0137","start":137,"end":139,"surface":"寧氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0146","start":146,"end":147,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"9u9_ae0_0oz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0152","start":152,"end":157,"surface":"孔、暴之屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"朱彊","kind":"person","person_id":"1iw_7ww_ynr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0176","start":176,"end":178,"surface":"杜衍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0179","start":179,"end":181,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0212","start":212,"end":213,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0231","start":231,"end":235,"surface":"二百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0237","start":237,"end":241,"surface":"賓客昆弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0246","start":246,"end":250,"surface":"二百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0251","start":251,"end":252,"surface":"縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m027-0270","start":270,"end":274,"surface":"四百餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p038","text":"減宣者，楊人也。以佐史無害給事河東守府。衞將軍靑使買馬河東，見宣無害，言上，徴爲大廐丞。官事辨，稍遷至御史及中丞。使治主父偃及治淮南反獄，所以微文深詆，殺者甚衆，稱爲敢決疑。數廢數起，爲御史及中丞者幾二十歳。王温舒免中尉，而宣爲左内史。其治米鹽，事大小皆關其手，自部署縣名曹實物，官吏令丞不得擅搖，痛以重法繩之。居官數年，一切郡中爲小治辨，然獨宣以小致大，能因力行之，難以爲經。中廢。爲右扶風，坐怨成信，信亡藏上林中，宣使郿令格殺信，吏卒格信時，射中上林苑門，宣下吏詆罪，以爲大逆，當族，自殺。而杜周任用。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0020","start":20,"end":24,"surface":"衞將軍靑","kind":"person","person_id":"up1_nzr_gq1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"主父偃","kind":"person","person_id":"vbr_ff1_yc4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0104","start":104,"end":107,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0140","start":140,"end":144,"surface":"官吏令丞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0199","start":199,"end":201,"surface":"成信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0202","start":202,"end":203,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0209","start":209,"end":210,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0211","start":211,"end":213,"surface":"郿令","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"吏卒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0220","start":220,"end":221,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"gbb_0p6_20p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0230","start":230,"end":231,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m038-0248","start":248,"end":250,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p039","text":"杜周者，南陽杜衍人。義縱爲南陽守，以爲爪牙，舉爲廷尉史。事張湯，湯數言其無害，至御史。使案邊失亡，所論殺甚衆。奏事中上意，任用，與減宣相編，更爲中丞十餘歳。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m039-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m039-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"義縱","kind":"person","person_id":"sg1_243_d92","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m039-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"1ex_se1_yef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m039-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"1ex_se1_yef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m039-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m039-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"減宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p040","text":"其治與宣相放，然重遲，外寬，内深次骨。宣爲左内史，周爲廷尉，其治大放張湯而善候伺。上所欲擠者，因而陷之；上所欲釋者，久繫待問而微見其冤狀。客有讓周曰：「君爲天子決平，不循三尺法，專以人主意指爲獄。獄者固如是乎？」周曰：「三尺安出哉？前主所是著爲律，後主所是疎爲令，當時爲是，何古之法乎！」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"宣","kind":"person","person_id":"qpo_0gi_vsj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"張湯","kind":"person","person_id":"1ex_se1_yef_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0052","start":52,"end":53,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"前主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m040-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"後主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p041","text":"至周爲廷尉，詔獄亦益多矣。二千石繋者新故相因，不減百餘人。郡吏大府舉之廷尉，一歳至千餘章。章大者連逮證案數百，小者數十人；遠者數千，近者數百里。會獄，吏因責如章告劾，不服，以笞掠定之。於是聞有逮皆亡匿。獄久者至更數赦十有餘歳而相告言，大抵盡詆以不道以上。廷尉及中都官詔獄逮至六七萬人，吏所增加十萬餘人。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m041-0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m041-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"二千石","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m041-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"郡吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m041-0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m041-0130","start":130,"end":133,"surface":"中都官","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m041-0142","start":142,"end":143,"surface":"吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p042","text":"周中廢，後爲執金時，逐盜，捕治桑弘羊、衞皇后昆弟子刻深，天子以爲盡力無私，遷爲御史大夫。家兩子，夾河爲守。其治暴酷皆甚於王温舒等矣。杜周初徴爲廷史，有一馬，且不全；及身久任事，至三公列，子孫尊官，家訾累數巨萬矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"桑弘羊","kind":"person","person_id":"fi2_2cl_w22","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0019-person","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"衞皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"52y_wzf_jzz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0019","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"昆弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"兩子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"王温舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6ym_eva_k4a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"杜周","kind":"person","person_id":"dxx_6m8_7o6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m042-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p043","text":"太史公曰：自郅都、杜周十人者，此皆以酷烈爲聲。然郅都伉直，引是非，爭天下大體。張湯以知陰陽，人主與倶上下，時數辯當否，國家賴其便。趙禹時據法守正。杜周從諛，以少言爲重。自張湯死後，網密，多詆嚴，官事寖以秏廢。九卿碌碌┐其官，救過不贍，何暇論繩墨之外乎！然此十人中，其廉者足以爲儀表，其汚者足以爲戒，方略教導，禁姦止邪，一切亦皆彬彬質有其文武焉。雖慘酷，斯稱其位矣。至若蜀守馮當暴挫，廣漢李貞擅磔人，東郡彌仆鋸項，天水駱璧推咸，河東褚廣妄殺，京兆無忌、馮翊殷周蝮鷙，水衡閻奉樸撃賣請，何足數哉！何足數哉！","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m043-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"42d_lp1_gxc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m043-0006","start":6,"end":8,"sur